<title>FRANCE: Saint-Gobain raises dividend. [CORRECTED 18:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Saint-Gobain raises dividend. [CORRECTED 18:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>French glass maker Saint-Gobain said in a statement on Thursday it was proposing to pay a 1996 dividend of 17 francs net per share, or 0.50 francs more than last year.</p>
<p>The gross dividend is 25.50 francs per share.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend date is June 27 (corrects from June 17). The dividend can be paid out in shares.</p>
</text>
